                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Every sheet becomes a centred dialog from 700: 480 wide for results, leave and sound, 560 for scoreboard, last trick, undealt cards and how to play. Same content and scrim, radius 22 on all corners.",
